# Only what the build copies: engines/rust, packs, runner (without its build
# output and test tooling), the explain viewer the binary embeds, NOTICE and
# LICENSE.
*
!engines/rust
!packs
!runner
!tools/explain/viewer.html
!NOTICE
!LICENSE
**/target
runner/fieldkit/e2e/node_modules
runner/fieldkit/e2e/.run
runner/fieldkit/e2e/test-results
